      "body": "### Remove the redundant true term from settings equality\n\n**Severity:** `low`\n\nNon-blocking cleanup: `&& true` does not exclude command hotkeys or change the comparison result. The comparer already documents that `HotkeyManager` refreshes command hotkeys separately, so ending the expression after `EnableDock` preserves both the behavior and its explanation without the redundant Boolean term.\n\n```suggestion\n                && x.EnableDock == y.EnableDock;\n```",
